<title>USA: TABLE-USX-Delhi Group Q2 net shr loss $0.16.</title>
<headline>TABLE-USX-Delhi Group Q2 net shr loss $0.16.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second Quarter  Six Months</p>
<p>						     Ended	Ended</p>
<p>						    June 30    June 30</p>
<p>(Dollars in millions,</p>
<p>  except per share amounts)	 1997   1996    1997    1996</p>
<p> REVENUES			     $268.0 $217.4  $606.7  $495.0</p>
<p>    Total operating costs	  264.3  214.0   595.4   483.1</p>
<p> OPERATING INCOME			3.7    3.4    11.3    11.9</p>
<p> NET INCOME (LOSS)		   (1.5)  (1.2)    (.1)     1.2</p>
<p>Net income (loss) per share</p>
<p>    - Primary and fully diluted (0.16) (0.12)  (0.01)    0.13</p>
<p>  Dividends paid per share	  0.05   0.05    0.10    0.10</p>
<p>Weighted average shares,</p>
<p>in thousands</p>
<p>    - Primary and fully diluted  9,451  9,450   9,450   9,449</p>
<p>NOTE: The company's net loss adjusted for special items was $2.6 million, or $0.27 per share, compared with a net loss of $1.2 million, or $0.12 cents per share, in 1996.</p>
